From 3ddf936fbe1a33337d24bda7a6bcf209c2553024 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ultimatejeeves <ultimatejeeves@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 13:08:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 33/43] Handoffs: spin before sleeping, fewer clock reads,
 signal only waiting receivers; VU1: skip MAC/sticky flags nothing reads; SW
 raster: row tables, lazy texel decode; catch-up at frame end only

